* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# Windows batch files must keep CRLF.
#
# `cmd.exe` reads a `.bat` line by line and treats a lone LF as part of the
# line, so an LF-only batch file fails in ways that read as a broken toolchain
# — Gradle's wrapper is the one that matters here, and a checkout that
# normalised it to LF would break `npm run package:android` on a machine where
# nothing had changed. The `-text` disables the conversion; `eol=crlf` states
# what the file is.
*.bat -text eol=crlf
*.cmd -text eol=crlf
